**Core logic (stripped of obfuscation):**
```java
int n = sc.nextInt();
int count = 0, poss = 0;
for (int i = 0; i < n; i++) {
    int u = sc.nextInt();
    int v = sc.nextInt();
    if (u == v) {
        count++;
    } else {
        count = 0;
    }
    if (count >= 3) {
        poss = 1;
    }
}
System.out.println(poss != 0 ? "Yes" : "No");
```

